  /// lifetime. Beyond the cap the oldest-settled entries are pruned (LRU by
  /// settle time); their log FILES stay on disk and exact-id lookups fall
  /// back to them ([prunedLogPath]/[tailFromLog], AC4). Running jobs are
  /// never pruned.
